0.00 -12.00 TD
(authority of correcting / altering / withdrawing the result at any time. Any comments from the Head of Institutes regarding the published result should be reported in written within 06 May, 2026. No complain) Tj
0.00 -12.00 TD
(will be entertained after the expiry of the stipulated time.) Tj
0.00 -12.00 TD
